-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/AAFS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/APT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Strongly deformed and/or metamorphosed bedrock. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Llandovery Epoch (Silurian Period) (443.1-432.9 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/BAUM> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/BORO> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/CNSQ> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/EGTI> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Obsolete name. Sandy diamicton. Stratified superficial deposits. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Devensian Stage (Quaternary Period) (.116-.0118 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LAIL1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LAIL2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LAIL3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LAILU> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LEDS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LUCB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/NTBG> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Stratified superficial deposits. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Devensian Stage - to - Holocene Epoch (Quaternary Period) (.116-0 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/PARH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Strongly deformed and/or metamorphosed bedrock. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Silurian Period (443.1-419 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/S141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Superficial deposits. Occurs onshore. Age not entered."@en .
